Bundled bitmap fonts
====================

The three BDF files in this directory are copied unmodified from the X.Org
misc-misc font package:

  Source:  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/font/misc-misc
  Commit:  c4e2af05583764fae3d0b2aa20d5c93b031cbcbf
           ("font-misc-misc 1.1.3", 2023-02-27)

  | badgemagic font | file     | cell (w x h) | SHA-256                                                          |
  |-----------------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | normal          | 6x10.bdf | 6 x 10       | 99abf27fa2ca5a5171cad3df13aed2d4c55e73698cb141981b3e2268c733f64c |
  | compact         | 5x8.bdf  | 5 x 8        | 72dbfa5359a1f327ce87b9db6371bdc98c057619605532c0010550ac76b08a35 |
  | tiny            | 4x6.bdf  | 4 x 6        | dab0fc40105137bae55cd60c8f061c942787a4da21e44df28deca1525851a9c0 |

These are the classic X11 "fixed" fonts maintained by Markus Kuhn. They are in
the public domain. Each file carries this statement in its COPYRIGHT property:

  5x8.bdf and 4x6.bdf:  "Public domain font.  Share and enjoy."
  6x10.bdf:             "Public domain terminal emulator font.  Share and enjoy."

and the package's COPYING file reads "Public domain font.  Share and enjoy."

Do not edit these files. To update them, copy the new versions from the
upstream repository and update the commit and hashes above.
